Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2. Stabilized Core Claims", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"a1ae29fd-7aad-d343-af78-3c5b14b03c78"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Ontological Core", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"66ae777e-13bc-134e-836c-f13965133b1a"],

Cell["Existence is stabilization at scale.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"9148eccd-39ea-f04a-bb36-ea8be3d315b4"],

Cell["Reality is recursively organized closure.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"03f94001-85bc-984b-982c-2291a2752e7b"],

Cell["\<\
Lower-scale stable structures compose higher-scale structures.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ac7c2465-d54a-5a4c-8949-27e4bc34e9ca"],

Cell["Higher-scale structures constrain lower-scale structures.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"babe0422-db4e-ba4b-8b15-59231c47f2a3"],

Cell["\<\
Time is the ordered trace of recursive self-measurement and stabilization.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"a673372a-7814-f64a-b1af-f51f7c3a8ea7"],

Cell["Memory is required for temporal continuity.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"1401c743-3bd4-9948-86db-3a62c7ca0f85"],

Cell["Matter is stabilized informational geometry.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"f3dc5330-f1a7-8e45-a51a-6b51569c2be7"],

Cell["\<\
Mass is the burden of maintaining densely stabilized information across scale \
and time.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"a7d356d2-1e0c-664c-a843-04ae5bccbafe"],

Cell["Gravity is a field response to burden density gradients.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"26e6e240-50d7-cf48-85e0-579c5d81ef50"],

Cell["\<\
Inertia is resistance to reconfiguration of stabilized informational \
structure.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"6fcaa233-2eb4-cb41-a979-3443da991350"],

Cell["\<\
Consciousness is the interior aspect of sufficiently rich recursive \
self-measurement with continuity and memory.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"4e9e6f6c-34df-bc49-a442-3a883f8d333c"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Structural Core", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"7fbee4f3-c047-df41-bb80-ad71da3dcf0d"],

Cell["\<\
Spherical closure means direction-complete bounded self-related closure, not \
literal roundness.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"fed2f647-d553-1348-be7c-8a03398416a8"],

Cell["\<\
Fractality means recurrence of stabilization logic across scales, not merely \
visual repetition.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"8c576869-b039-d647-866e-5887b19668d6"],

Cell["\<\
Geometry is the constraint structure over possible stable relations.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"9dc2c450-55ca-9742-a1d1-61863c1007fd"],

Cell["\<\
Golden-ratio/Fibonacci organization is treated as a candidate efficient \
recursive scan or growth law, subject to computational and empirical testing.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"4c0b27e5-05aa-0141-b2d8-fdd6c6d14308"],

