Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["5. Working Answers to the Foundational Questions", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"63e7c859-8a9b-4444-9997-738afa135a23"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Q1. Primitive ontology", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"34fdd656-0e8f-8e4e-aa03-096ce43cda06"],

Cell["\<\
Best current formalization: a hybrid of logical-geometric possibility, \
informational distinction, and multiscale stabilization. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"af7d0d54-62dd-764a-aaf4-f66896dc3fc9"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Q2. Meaning of \"sphere\"", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"4dee5504-f704-5840-bbd4-a23eac395682"],

Cell["\<\
A sphere is treated as idealized maximal directional completeness under \
bounded self-relation, not merely Euclidean roundness. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"82a8f706-a6f2-6f4d-a7e5-6bd1cc0ba0f1"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Q3. What makes a structure stable?", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"a56355ad-b180-d343-a007-5d524aed8b2a"],

Cell["\<\
Stability is modeled as persistent recursive self-maintenance with low drift, \
sufficient closure, and low dissipative loss relative to scale. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"eaa5565c-fa19-1f4f-b5cc-9be7665bcb48"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Q4. What is measurement?", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"030d14b9-ec10-2340-acda-534a9771838d"],

Cell["\<\
Measurement is modeled as recursive distinction-and-return: projection, \
reflection, discrepancy evaluation, stabilization, and memory update. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1bc0a58a-a046-5a4a-ad85-8e07916b7ed7"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Q5. What is memory?", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"a9d3a2e1-6e20-4f44-bf43-cce1905da0f9"],

Cell["\<\
Memory is the retained lawful trace of prior measurement that constrains \
future stabilization. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fb060fcc-b76a-cb47-b0b7-7548883f19c0"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Q6. Matter vs non-matter", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"0d70efd9-22ac-b94a-a85f-02f8b157114a"],

Cell["\<\
Matter is treated as a high-density, high-closure, persistent stabilization \
regime. Non-matter is lower-persistence or less bounded structure. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"423ac6d9-1f88-8347-aa09-ec39b1d3a297"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Q7. Information density and mass", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"90342d23-3990-6a46-b8a5-a712c5c3e7c6"],

Cell["\<\
The strongest current relation is monotonic but likely nonlinear and \
closure-dependent: mass is modeled as accumulated burden of maintaining \
densely stabilized information. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5bae34b9-4b5f-8745-8214-d9e6362e0cc3"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Q8. Gravity", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"c5a047ca-e8bf-7a4c-aa5b-8bec5fddf476"],

Cell["\<\
Gravity is provisionally modeled as burden-potential response or \
burden-gradient flow in the stabilizing field. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"27cbba3d-9aed-1e46-ab97-93f34f4b448d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Q9. Fibonacci/golden ratio", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"7b2e654b-fd21-1f4f-8e95-df08c9b3ea58"],

Cell["\<\
These are treated as candidate laws for efficient recursive coverage, scan \
scheduling, anti-resonance, and multiscale phase decorrelation. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9a5b26f6-8588-7745-b865-0072286793b0"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Q10. Minimum structural requirements for consciousness", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"167b9cf0-980b-4d45-8f20-335b5a17588d"],

Cell["Most important current components:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6f27faed-e9a6-8f45-93b0-e0bc5657e887"],

Cell["1. temporal continuity", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a98d2509-3620-d449-8974-0d3487194636"],

Cell["2. memory", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"92a9ed90-9de4-0f4a-a77d-0b11fda58db7"],

Cell["3. recursive self-modeling/self-measurement", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5e4678b4-dd19-8547-ad91-3d1c9c497593"],

Cell["4. integration", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c23179c7-f4ed-6642-bc4e-f854ae7f8250"],

Cell["5. prediction/counterfactual capacity", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"898f4d13-070a-e844-81d2-7e5d6d85b6e7"],

Cell["6. self/world distinction", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"742415c3-3c72-b041-af1b-2f9fffd6673f"],

Cell["7. embodied closure ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7c28f865-1daa-6940-957e-3e1dabc709e6"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Q11. Is every stable system conscious?", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"78f0fa79-13c0-1947-90f6-431d4d5c4a40"],

Cell["\<\
No. RHUFT currently supports a graded distinction between generic stability \
and sufficiently rich self-modeling, memory-bearing, temporally continuous \
systems. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1213f042-8d50-884a-b9ca-3c74f83e27b9"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Q12. Intended scope", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"5f3b6ad0-01f6-8145-952a-0781f336e21d"],

Cell["RHUFT is best treated as layered across: ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"db98f496-81e3-4844-8439-a74747143637"],

Cell["metaphysical framework", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"15b292e9-fb5c-074b-bcce-49b355d6fdf4"],

Cell["computational architecture", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"b71eff0c-e5df-2d4c-aea1-7e96d6ec8ed7"],

Cell["physical unification attempt", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"21de295b-9af6-0a4e-9085-2d67296a6a71"],

Cell["consciousness theory", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"29d0df05-6717-d645-b2d3-c1a8f60ecd4d"],

